"] and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"[","type":"text"},{"code":"clamp_overrides_to_org","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"] read, so it is set out rather than inferred. ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ordered"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tenant may be stricter than its organization and never more permissive: *","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"[","type":"text"},{"code":"Self::sensitive_scopes_enabled","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"], validated ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"disable-only"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — the mirror image of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"mfa_enforced","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", because releasing personal data is the less-restrictive direction, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tenant can turn its organization’s decision off but never on. * [","type":"text"},{"code":"Self::saml_idp_enabled","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"],","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"validated ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"disable-only","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" exactly like [","type":"text"},{"code":"Self::sensitive_scopes_enabled","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"] (D-20): a tenant","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"may turn its organization’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" off and never its ","type":"text"},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on. * [","type":"text"},{"code":"Self::ssf_enabled","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"],","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"validated ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"disable-only","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" the same way (D-45). * [","type":"text"},{"code":"Self::dynamic_registration","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"], on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ladder ","type":"text"},{"code":"disabled","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" → ","type":"text"},{"code":"initial_access_token","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" → ","type":"text"},{"code":"anonymous","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": a tenant may move down it and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"never up. * [","type":"text"},{"code":"Self::dcr_max_clients","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"] and [","type":"text"},{"code":"Self::dcr_unused_client_ttl_days","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"], on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ordinary ","type":"text"},{"code":"tenant <= org","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" rule — with the wrinkle that ","type":"text"},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on the second means ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"never sweep","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which is the longest window of all and is handled by [","type":"text"},{"code":"dcr_ttl_strictness","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"]. ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ordered","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":", therefore never validated against the baseline and never clamped: *","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"[","type":"text"},{"code":"Self::default_locale","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"]. A language is a presentation preference; there is no sense in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which Italian is stricter than French. * [","type":"text"},{"code":"Self::dcr_allowed_scopes","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"],","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"[","type":"text"},{"code":"Self::dcr_allowed_redirect_hosts","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"] and [","type":"text"},{"code":"Self::external_client_allowed_resources","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"]. Each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"names per-tenant resources — ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"this"}]